/// A nutritionist-pinned exception to the target formula: profiles matching the
/// criteria get these targets instead of the computed ones. Most specific band wins.
/// Field names intentionally mirror NutritionPlanTemplate criteria so the matching
/// predicates in nutritionTemplateMatch are reused as-is.
